{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>港鐵今早8時17分指，香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，港島線整體行車時間預計需延5至8分鐘。至8時42分，港鐵指信號設備故障已修復，港島線列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:24:00.337826+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:48:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T01:17:36.653336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:17:36.653336+00:00","content_hash":"f9e3ea17ff948480175ef0b20c12537fc3446bccd7feab5f4e1476887b365837","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}